WEBVTT

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.580
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.110
Kono hiroi sekai no naka

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:28.290
Deaubeki hitotachi ga

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:34.860
Mado no mukou niji no mukou ni mieru

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.490
Kizuite iru hazu

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:45.610
Kyuukutsu na omori o nuide

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:48.580
Kimochi o yurushite

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:55.890
Saa mimi o sumashi sono toki o matte

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.650
Ima mezamenasai

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:11.970
Oozora ni egaita chiisa na
yume o taisetsu ni shiyou

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:19.210
Sou sureba itsumo shiawase ni nareru

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:21.980
Kitto

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:26.350
Woh woh

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:58.280
Ah! Shimmer Without Fear of the Darkness!

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:34.680
Ichinichi oeru tabi

00:22:34.680 --> 00:22:47.660
"Kyou mo anata no koto daisuki deshita" to
sotto mune ni omou

00:22:47.660 --> 00:22:51.800
Omoikaeseba hora

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:57.170
Nakitsukareta hi mo atta keredo

00:22:57.170 --> 00:23:06.010
Sonna yoru o ikutsu mo koete
tadoritsuita basho

00:23:06.010 --> 00:23:10.420
Soshite maku aketa story

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:16.720
Nandaka yume mitai na real

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:25.000
Sukoshi terewarainagara mo tsunaida te wa

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:35.580
Kitto kazoekirenu hodo no
ai no yokan ga afuredashite iru

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:45.050
Datte magire mo naku hoka de
mo nai anata to atashi wa

00:23:45.050 --> 00:23:50.080
Koibito doushi na no

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:09.500
Ah! The Chair of Demonkind Descends!
